About me
A Graduate Transport Planner at Stantec, with expertise in spatial data analytics, GIS and QUANT. I hold an MSc from the Bartlett, University College London and a BSc from the University of Manchester. I am experienced in processing and analysing complex datasets, producing clear visualisation, and translating findings into evidence-based recommendations. I am committed to applying digital urban analytics in navigating complexities and delivering well-informed and inclusive long-term solutions to address challenges.


